        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 安装与连接\n\n本机审核配置是`qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` + `mmh3-8b-ClipProj-v3.1.safetensors`。单独安装`nicolab28/ComfyUI-ClipProj >= 0.1.13`，编码器放到`models/text_encoders`，矩阵放到`models/clip_projections`。单卡先用官方Load CLIP再接ClipProj Apply；本审计节点接在Apply后、H3 Conditioning前，只原样透传CLIP。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② 必须匹配维度与模态",
      "pos": [
        820,
        520
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        330
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 4,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 不能把小编码器当无损替换\n\n4B矩阵输入应为2560、8B应为4096，输出必须5120；text-only Qwen3即使维度相同也会被拒绝。I2VA/FL2VA把`has_reference_images`打开，Ref2VA把`has_reference_videos`打开。审计PASS只证明合同匹配，不证明等同32B，也不证明中文、专名、对白和参考遵循度。"
      ]
    }
